window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Half-vampire Cat Crawfield and her vampire husband Bones have fought for their lives, as well as for their relationship. But just when they've triumphed over the latest battle, Cat's new and unexpected abilities threaten to upset a long-standing balance...</p> <p>Performed by Yasmin Tuazon, Danny Gavigan, James Konicek, Niusha Nawab, Christopher Graybill, Shawn K. Jain, Dawn Ursula, Tyler Hyrchuk, Troy Allan, David Cui Cui, Peter Holdway, Alex Hill-Knight, Amanda Forstrom, Anthony Palmini, Bradley Foster Smith, Dan Delgado, Elena Anderson, Eric Messner, Gabriel Michael, Henry W. Kramer, Holly Adams, Julienne Irons, Karen Novack, Karenna Foley, Laura C. Harris, Marni Penning, Michael Glenn, Michael John Casey, Mike Carnes, Mort Shelby, Nanette Savard, Patrick Boylan, Rayner Gabriel, Robb Moreira, Rose Elizabeth Supan, Stewart Crank, Torian Brackett, Wyn Delano, and Zeke Alton.</p>"; 
